Description: ROS 2 driver for Xsens MTi IMU sensors
 ROS 2 driver node for Movella/Xsens MTi series inertial measurement units
 (e.g. MTi-680G/MTi-8/MTi-630/MTi-300). It publishes orientation, inertial,
 magnetic, GNSS and status data, and bundles the Xsens Device API
 (xspublic) for device communication.
 .
 This package builds only the xsens_mti_ros2_driver package for ROS 2 Jazzy;
 the optional NTRIP client is not included.
